# CatDex Design System

**Source of truth:** `src/theme/` via `useTheme()` from `@/theme`. Never hardcode hex/rgba or ad-hoc spacing. Do not use tokens from `ChatDex Mobile App UI/` (Figma/web export).

```ts
import { useTheme } from '@/theme';
const { colors, spacing, radius, typography, shadow, gradients, motion, iconSize } = useTheme();
```

## Colors (dark-first — light/dark palettes are identical)

| Token | Value |
|---|---|
| `background` | `#060816` |
| `surface` | `#10152B` |
| `surfaceSecondary` | `#161D38` |
| `surfaceTertiary` | `#1C2444` |
| `text` | `#FFFFFF` |
| `textBody` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.78)` |
| `textSecondary` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.55)` |
| `placeholder` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.35)` |
| `accent` / `primary` | `#6E87FF` |
| `accentStrong` / `violet` | `#8D7BFF` |
| `accentSoft` | `rgba(110,135,255,0.18)` |
| `primarySoft` | `rgba(110,135,255,0.16)` |
| `mint` / `success` | `#5EE4B0` |
| `yellow` / `warning` | `#FFD56A` |
| `orange` | `#FF9F6B` |
| `sky` | `#6EC8FF` |
| `rose` | `#FF8FB3` |
| `danger` | `#FF6B8A` |
| `border` | `rgba(255,255,255,0.08)` |
| `overlay` | `rgba(6,8,22,0.72)` |
| `glassFill` | `rgba(16,21,43,0.72)` |
| `tabBar` | `rgba(6,8,22,0.92)` |
| `gradientStart` → `gradientEnd` | `#6E87FF` → `#8D7BFF` |
| `onAccent` / `onPrimary` / `onSurface` | `#FFFFFF` |

Soft variants (`mintSoft`, `yellowSoft`, …) use `rgba(..., 0.16)`. Coat themes: `src/lib/catTheme.ts` only.

**Gradients** (`gradients`): `primary`, `primarySoft`, `surface`, `hero`, `capture`, `xp`.

## Typography

Fonts: iOS System (SF); Android/web Syne (display) + Manrope (body).

Use `<Text variant="…" color="…" />` — do not invent font sizes.

| Variant | Size / Line / Tracking |
|---|---|
| `display` | 40 / 48 / -1.2 |
| `h1` | 32 / 40 / -0.8 |
| `h2` | 24 / 32 / -0.4 |
| `h3` | 20 / 28 / -0.2 |
| `body` | 16 / 24 / -0.1 |
| `bodySmall` | 14 / 20 / 0 |
| `caption` | 12 / 16 / 0.1 |
| `label` | 12 / 16 / 0.8 uppercase |

## Spacing — 8pt grid only

Allowed: `4 · 8 · 16 · 24 · 32 · 40 · 48 · 64 · 96`  
Aliases: `xs=4 sm=8 md=16 lg=24 xl=32 2xl=40 3xl=48 4xl=64 5xl=96`  
Use `spacing.md`, not magic numbers outside this scale.

## Radius

`12 · 16 · 20 · 24 · 28 · 32 · full(9999)`  
Aliases: `sm=12 md=16 lg=20 xl=24 sheet=28 2xl=32`  
Convention: buttons `20`, cards `24`, sheets `28`, FAB `full`.

## Shadow / Motion / Icons

Shadows: `shadow.small | medium | large | glow` (glow = Scanner FAB only). Also `accentShadow`.  
Motion duration: `instant=80 fast=160 normal=240 slow=400 reveal=600`. Press scales: `0.96` / card `0.98`.  
Icons: `sm=16 md=24 lg=32 xl=40`; stroke `1.5` / `1.8`.

## Component naming

- Folder + PascalCase file: `src/components/Button/Button.tsx`, barrel `index.ts`.
- Export from `@/components` when shared.
- Prefer existing primitives: `Text`, `Button` (`primary|secondary|ghost|icon`), `TextInput`/`SearchInput`/`Textarea`, `Card`/`GlassCard`/`ImageCard`/`PhotoCard`/`GalleryCard`/`StatCard`, `Badge`, `Chip`, `Avatar`, `ProgressBar`/`XPBar`, `BottomSheet`, `Modal`, `Toast`, `EmptyState`, `Spinner`/`Skeleton`.
- Screens live in `app/`; feature UI may be colocated but must consume theme tokens.
- Brand: **CatDex** — slogan “Ton quartier. Tes chats.” (`src/constants/design.ts`).

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<View style={{ backgroundColor: '#1a1a2e', padding: 12, borderRadius: 8 }} />
<Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#ccc' }}>Title</Text>

// ✅ GOOD
const { colors, spacing, radius } = useTheme();
<View style={{ backgroundColor: colors.surface, padding: spacing.md, borderRadius: radius.xl }} />
<Text variant="h3" color="text">Title</Text>
```
